# Deny-by-default: every Dockerfile in this repo builds a Maven service, so the
# context is limited to what the reactor needs. Keeps Render builds from shipping
# the 2.8GB web workspace and node_modules trees over the wire.
#
# `*` hides nested files, including services/**/Dockerfile. Remote builders
# (Render BuildKit) read the Dockerfile from the uploaded context, so parent
# dirs and their contents must both be re-included or the build dies with
# "open Dockerfile: no such file or directory".
*
!pom.xml
!mvnw
!mvnw.cmd
!.mvn
!.mvn/**
!config
!config/**
!services
!services/**
!tests
!tests/**

services/**/target
**/.DS_Store
**/*.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example
